            "review_title": "Review at Cơm Tấm Ốp Lết 1940",
            "review_text": "Ethan M\nTaguig City, Philippines284 contributions\n0\nOMG Must visit Good Com Tam\nNov 2025 • Couples\nLet me share a secret with you. This place has excellent food. Looks like not a lot of people now about it so I'm putting it out here on Trip Advisor. This place is a must visit if you're in Da Nang. Food is so good! And it's super affordable and the vibe is awesome. Like a 1940's restaurant which I think is what they were going for. But come for the excellent food. Must visit.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nTry the com tam. Of course. It's what they're known for. I should've ordered more food knowing how good it was.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 3, 2025",
